              Sort <math id="alg1.l21.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathcal{C}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒞</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathcal{C}</annotation></semantics></math> by <math id="alg1.l21.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathit{score}^{\prime}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msup><mi>𝑠𝑐𝑜𝑟𝑒</mi><mo>′</mo></msup><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathit{score}^{\prime}</annotation></semantics></math> in descending order

